{% layout 'novinzo' %}

<nz-order-detail
  order-id="{{ order.orderId }}"
  store-name="{{ store.name }}"
  store-logo-url="{% if store.logoImageUrl %}{{ store.logoImageUrl | image_url: width: 64 }}{% endif %}"
  data-island="nz-order-detail"
  data-hydrate="eager"
></nz-order-detail>

{%- comment -%}
  Connect Discord, from the Discord app: the buyer links their Discord account to the order,
  and the store's bot gives that account the roles the store set for what was bought. It is
  first under the order because a role is part of what the order delivers, and it is not given
  until the buyer links. It renders nothing for a store without the app, and shows nothing
  until the store has connected its Discord server.
{%- endcomment -%}
{% plugin_block "discord/order-discord@1", order_id: order.orderId %}

{%- comment -%} Review forms for the order's lines, when the store has the reviews plugin; nothing until the order is paid. {%- endcomment %}
{% plugin_block "reviews/order-reviews@1", order_id: order.orderId %}
